1406	tck	37	TCK Madde 38 - Azmettirme - Madde 38- (1) Başkasını suç işlemeye azmettiren kişi, işlenen suçun cezası ile cezalandırılır. (2) Üstsoy ve altsoy ilişkisinden doğan nüfuz kullanılmak suretiyle suça azmettirme halinde, azmettirenin cezası üçte birden yarısına kadar artırılır. Çocukların suça azmettirilmesi halinde, bu fıkra hükmüne göre cezanın artırılabilmesi için üstsoy ve altsoy ilişkisinin varlığı aranmaz. (3) Azmettirenin belli olmaması halinde, kim olduğunun ortaya çıkmasını sağlayan fail veya diğer suç ortağı hakkında ağırlaştırılmış müebbet hapis cezası yerine yirmi yıldan yirmibeş yıla kadar, müebbet hapis cezası yerine onbeş yıldan yirmi yıla kadar hapis cezasına hükmolunabilir. Diğer hallerde verilecek cezada, üçte bir oranında indirim yapılabilir.	[0.007078485,0.07287419,-0.019281905,-0.031950295,0.03215814,0.03181715,0.08769383,0.10430607,0.003818682,0.06740471,0.13666728,-0.006876209,-0.01026569,-0.026466932,-0.029411027,0.012858099,-0.011576873,0.06507608,-0.100784846,-0.0372996,-0.038468923,-0.0017101861,0.059134107,-0.06634951,0.032890707,-0.050425064,-0.029641524,-0.03340989,-0.020073168,-0.025455294,-0.07265059,0.018973991,-0.05821963,0.02123397,-0.04149336,-0.068331145,0.028213905,0.057263173,-0.0272312,-0.040722594,-0.033527013,0.044098184,-0.04462208,0.038269207,-0.041933548,-0.052520163,0.003781482,-0.007539212,-0.13372043,-0.030904166,0.05371664,0.031362485,0.02070308,0.102803625,0.019298105,-0.056739137,-0.037017047,-0.0041575213,-0.053957734,0.01638875,0.014619364,0.04431033,-0.010832306,-0.040011458,-0.009333028,-0.015277326,0.022322811,-0.03827461,-0.012346119,0.1139952,-0.030145202,-0.024695475,-0.08469933,0.009554563,-0.022402294,0.0077124937,-0.025428284,0.15590999,0.034702554,-0.09688512,0.008298994,-0.004434304,0.045239426,-0.11630568,-0.06630419,-0.015095242,-0.033321075,0.0023422758,0.015569163,0.02281086,0.02570137,0.0025569228,0.17636295,-0.04646976,-0.0015472054,0.052572414,-0.016763845,0.0050877277,0.026176013,0.074108