1411	tck	42	TCK Madde 43 - Zincirleme suç - Madde 43- (1) Bir suç işleme kararının icrası kapsamında, değişik zamanlarda bir kişiye karşı aynı suçun birden fazla işlenmesi durumunda, bir cezaya hükmedilir. Ancak bu ceza, dörtte birinden dörtte üçüne kadar artırılır. Bir suçun temel şekli ile daha ağır veya daha az cezayı gerektiren nitelikli şekilleri, aynı suç sayılır. (Ek cümle: 29/6/2005 – 5377/6 md.) Mağduru belli bir kişi olmayan suçlarda da bu fıkra hükmü uygulanır. (2) Aynı suçun birden fazla kişiye karşı tek bir fi lle işlenmesi durumunda da, birinci fıkra hükmü uygulanır. (3) Kasten öldürme, kasten yaralama, işkence ve yağma suçlarında bu madde hükümleri uygulanmaz.	[0.031370398,0.076501615,-0.026384495,-0.030836891,0.033370193,0.028608726,0.08946008,0.07692739,0.03721866,0.040926877,0.103836015,0.023580352,-0.048343588,-0.030373773,0.0014048473,-0.03555634,0.011575043,0.040608536,-0.11285935,-0.07450681,-0.015891047,0.002716409,0.04048786,-0.08440581,0.0349244,-0.05455827,-0.0424501,-0.04597458,-0.017229024,-0.026885532,-0.03920073,0.052788615,-0.035983264,0.0057257833,-0.027245246,-0.070534006,0.002360024,0.06989384,-0.019312402,-0.070227385,-0.01852265,0.10080173,-0.043283835,0.057286635,-0.026223727,-0.013244638,-0.023176806,-0.007574365,-0.09371684,-0.04236336,0.0727942,0.055934057,0.040981226,0.10660984,0.0050210096,-0.10739496,-0.07482403,0.037060734,-0.034443576,0.0038137138,0.010289511,0.06233924,-0.008257834,-0.046992276,0.011808881,-0.0055721756,0.03500648,-0.025426354,-0.037137944,0.1434244,-0.07860546,-0.015998634,-0.105753735,0.0012426261,-0.041289046,-0.001540164,-0.025020685,0.13878946,0.023465011,-0.040535785,0.0149514815,-0.012195649,0.0011260603,-0.106740825,-0.06936139,-0.0028986179,-0.025933247,0.017059237,0.046541195,0.03475325,0.053316917,-0.011607663,0.10688746,-0.06839039,-0.03698061,0.03153174,-0.008986526,0.0285203,0.0562434,0.115485884,0.02701654,-0.034612805,-0.08337433,0.07224937,0.039926674,0.051253036,0.03375622,-0.05951574,-