1471	tck	102	TCK Madde 104 - Reşit olmayanla cinsel ilişki - Madde 104- (1) Cebir, tehdit ve hile olmaksızın, onbeş yaşını bitirmiş olan çocukla cinsel ilişkide bulunan kişi, şikayet üzerine, iki yıldan beş yıla kadar hapis cezası ile cezalandırılır. Mevzuat Bilgi Sistemi (2) (İptal: Anayasa Mahkemesinin 23/11/2005 tarihli ve E: 2005/103, K: 2005/89 sayılı kararı ile; Yeniden düzenleme: 18/6/2014-6545/60 md.) Suçun mağdur ile arasında evlenme yasağı bulunan kişi tarafından işlenmesi hâlinde, şikâyet aranmaksızın, on yıldan on beş yıla kadar hapis cezasına hükmolunur. (3) (Ek: 18/6/2014-6545/60 md.) Suçun, evlat edineceği çocuğun evlat edinme öncesi bakımını üstlenen veya koruyucu aile ilişkisi çerçevesinde koruma, bakım ve gözetim yükümlülüğü bulunan kişi tarafından işlenmesi hâlinde, şikâyet aranmaksızın ikinci fıkraya göre cezaya hükmolunur.	[0.020491082,0.090163395,-0.044379618,-0.060202364,0.022136388,0.14167304,0.0001156291,0.073496945,0.07427901,0.08516456,0.10881495,0.022886602,0.0030568854,-0.01711681,-0.016644826,-0.033953216,-0.0134525895,-0.0010642702,-0.03381123,-0.00033594368,0.009375689,-0.009206034,0.0418842,-0.09407056,-0.022375453,-0.096162505,-0.061762568,-0.014313437,-0.059691913,0.022456605,-0.05918758,0.051473673,-0.08037668,0.06402954,-0.038900368,-0.09697887,0.013583729,0.030528191,-0.03204282,-0.0030267187,0.031824198,0.025752824,0.015666379,0.02002131,-0.049912486,0.01872518,-0.035018977,-0.015290457,-0.04063427,-0.060246304,0.015620097,0.0204957,0.07119446,0.111444406,0.0005218445,-0.06568685,-0.059117697,-0.026193043,-0.08125849,-0.014153644,0.00033419408,0.041503098,-0.011709316,-0.05118146,-0.058691658,0.015648536,-0.019335713,-0.049164295,0.04920441,0.009996272,-0.11182912,0.023619922,-0.15793924,0.036673322,-0.014125317,-0.0022550188,-0.017185895,0.12609565,0.02338394,-0.123382926,0.031285986,-0.015086751,0.06823468,-0.08130781,-0.118544504,-0.0454236,-0.015480367,0.025659835,-0.032825027,0.014158277,-0.0013527918,-0.016774444,0.094826