1483	tck	114	TCK Madde 116 - Konut dokunulmazlığının ihlali - Madde 116- (1) Bir kimsenin konutuna, konutunun eklentilerine rızasına aykırı olarak giren veya rıza ile girdikten sonra buradan çıkmayan kişi, mağdurun şikayeti üzerine, altı aydan iki yıla kadar hapis cezası ile cezalandırılır. (2) (Değişik: 31/3/2005 – 5328/8 md.) Birinci fıkra kapsamına giren fi llerin, açık bir rızaya gerek duyulmaksızın girilmesi mutat olan yerler dışında kalan işyerleri ve eklentileri hakkında işlenmesi hâlinde, mağdurun şikâyeti üzerine altı aydan bir yıla kadar hapis veya adlî para cezasına hükmolunur. (3) (Değişik: 31/3/2005 – 5328/8 md.) Evlilik birliğinde aile bireylerinden ya da konutun veya işyerinin birden fazla kişi tarafından ortak kullanılması durumunda, bu kişilerden birinin rızası varsa, yukarıdaki fıkralar hükümleri uygulanmaz. Ancak bunun için rıza açıklamasının meşru bir amaca yönelik olması gerekir. (4) Fiilin, cebir veya tehdit kullanılmak suretiyle ya da gece vakti işlenmesi halinde, bir yıldan üç yıla kadar hapis cezasına hükmolunur.	[0.061418254,0.07303224,-0.004368236,-0.045385502,0.08507325,0.023960872,0.03415365,0.07517714,0.0018445572,0.08106583,0.07734589,0.06918528,0.030836146,-0.03416528,-0.027229501,0.007390936,-0.050511967,0.042166453,-0.04519875,-0.00762929,-0.037234593,0.007561834,0.021085164,-0.054399308,0.04776559,-0.026306055,-0.04249691,-0.03171748,-0.041609555,0.011576807,-0.09553844,0.02271441,-0.08280888,0.04893205,0.03847266,-0.03809501,0.010489528,0.05119663,-0.016801503,-0.056718227,-0.049700856,0.034728833,0.00044338196,0.016643409,-0.049138866,0.0036484099,0.00562614,-0.05373108,-0.03352668,-0.06611018,0.055984,0.07494588,0.059514526,0.116016805,-0.042155914,-0.064659536,-0.028450705,-0.025536507,-0.059205607,0.007321857,0.0659159,0.03845451,-0.02373794,-0.028927378,-0.018551698,0.029053,-0.0057529975,-0.05032036,0.03584426,0.042462237,-0.08816513,0.02149723,-0.12619677,-0.023272105,0.061208107,-0.018912595,-0.03558753,0.13818808,0.031290